9, lateralG: 1.22 },\n    features: [\n      \"8,600 RPM Flat-Plane Crank NA V8 (Highest NA V8 HP in Production)\",\n      \"Carbon Fiber Aero Package (High Rear Wing & Ground Ground Effects)\",\n      \"Brembo Carbon Ceramic Brakes\",\n      \"Magnetic Selective Ride Control 4.0\",\n      \"Performance Data Recorder (PDR)\",\n      \"Bespoke Level 3 Leather & Carbon Fiber Interior\",\n    ],\n    image: \"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1583121274602-3e2820c69888?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80\",\n    gallery: [\n      \"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1583121274602-3e2820c69888?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80\",\n    ],\n    description: \"An American supercar revolution powered by a screaming 8,600-rpm flat-plane crank V8 with mid-engine track dominance.\",\n    isFeatured: false,\n    tags: [\"Flat-Plane V8\", \"8600 RPM\", \"Mid Engine\"],\n  },\n\n  // 22. Aston Martin DBX707 (Luxury SUV / Performance)\n  {\n    id: \"aston-martin-dbx707-2024\",\n    brand: \"Aston Martin\",\n    model: \"DBX\",\n    variant: \"DBX707\",\n    year: 2024,\n    price: 242000,\n    currency: \"USD\",\n    fuelType: \"Petrol\",\n    transmission: \"Automatic\",\n    bodyType: \"SUV\",\n    drivetrain: \"AWD\",\n    horsepower: 697,\n    torque: 663,\n    mileage: 17,\n    engine: \"4.0L Twin-Turbocharged AMG V8\",\n    seating: 5,\n    safetyRating: 5.0,\n    bootSpace: 638,\n    dimensions: { length: 5039, width: 1998, height: 1680, wheelbase: 3060 },\n    performance: { zeroToSixty: 3.1, topSpeed: 193 },\n    features: [\n      \"Wet-Clutch 9-Speed Transmission for Rapid Launches\",\n      \"Carbon Ceramic Brakes (420mm Front Discs)\",\n      \"Electronic Active Roll Control (eARC) System\",\n      \"Quad-Exit Active Valve Exhaust System\",\n      \"Carbon Fiber Front Splitter & Extended Rear Wing\",\n      \"Handcrafted Bridge of Weir Semi-Aniline Leather\",\n    ],\n    image: \"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1544829099-b9a0c07fad1a?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80\",\n    gallery: [\n      \"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1544829099-b9a0c07fad1a?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80\",\n    ],\n    description: \"The fastest and most powerful luxury SUV on earth, combining British elegance with thunderous 697 horsepower performance.\",\n    isFeatured: false,\n    tags: [\"British Luxury\", \"707 PS\", \"Super SUV\"],\n  },\n\n  // 23. Rimac Nevera (Electric / Hypercar)\n  {\n    id: \"rimac-nevera-2024\",\n    brand: \"Rimac\",\n    model: \"Nevera\",\n    variant: \"Time Attack Special\",\n    year: 2024,\n    price: 2200000,\n    currency: \"USD\",\n    fuelType: \"Electric\",\n    transmission: \"Direct-Drive\",\n    bodyType: \"Hypercar\",\n    drivetrain: \"AWD\",\n    horsepower: 1914,\n    torque: 1741,\n    mileage: 304, // 304 miles range\n    engine: \"Quad Bespoke Permanent-Magnet Electric Motors\",\n    seating: 2,\n    safetyRating: 5.0,\n    bootSpace: 100,\n    dimensions: { length: 4750, width: 1986, height: 1208, wheelbase: 2745 },\n    performance: { zeroToSixty: 1.74, topSpeed: 258, lateralG: 1.35, brakingDistance: 88 },\n    features: [\n      \"All-Wheel Torque Vectoring 2.0 (Calculates 100 times per second)\",\n      \"Full Carbon Fiber Monocoque with Integrated Battery Pack\",\n      \"Active Aerodynamic Wings, Diffusers, and Bonnet Flaps\",\n      \"120 kWh Liquid-Cooled Lithium Manganese Nickel Battery\",\n      \"Brembo CCMR Carbon-Ceramic Matrix Brakes\",\n      \"AI Driver Coach Telemetry System\",\n    ],\n    image: \"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1614162692292-7ac56d7f7f1e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80\",\n    gallery: [\n      \"https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1614162692292-7ac56d7f7f1e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1200&q=80\",\n    ],\n    description: \"The pinnacle of electric hypercar performance, holding over 20 world acceleration records with 1,914 horsepower.\",\n    isFeatured: true,\n    tags: [\"World Record\", \"1914 HP\", \"Hypercar\"],\n  },\n];\n","Description":"Create 23 vehicle seed dataset across all categories and body types","Overwrite":true,"TargetFile":"C:\\Users\\chauh\\.gemini\\antigravity\\scratch\\automind-ai\\frontend\\data\\vehicles.ts","toolAction":"Creating vehicle dataset","toolSummary":"Create frontend/data/vehicles.ts"}}]}
