ot types module. |\n\n---\n\n### 2. How the Vehicle Data Architecture Works\n\n```\n                                  +-----------------------------+\n                                  |    UI Screens & Features    |\n                                  |   (Explore, Compare, AI)    |\n                                  +-----------------------------+\n                                                 |\n                                                 v\n                                  +-----------------------------+\n                                  |       VehicleService        |\n                                  |  - getAllCars()             |\n                                  |  - getCarById(id)           |\n                                  |  - searchCars(query)        |\n                                  |  - filterCars(filters)      |\n                                  |  - sortCars(cars, sortBy)   |\n                                  |  - compareCars(ids)         |\n                                  |  - getFilterFacets()        |\n                                  +-----------------------------+\n                                                